---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import FormattedDate from '../../components/FormattedDate.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import EditorialHeading from '../../components/EditorialHeading.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import PoetryRightsNotice from '../../components/PoetryRightsNotice.astro';
import { poetry } from '../../data/poetry';

const latest = poetry[0] ?? null;
const earliest = poetry[poetry.length - 1] ?? null;
const poemsByYear = poetry.reduce((acc, entry) => {
  const year = entry.pubDateValue.getUTCFullYear();
  const bucket = acc.get(year) ?? [];
  bucket.push(entry);
  acc.set(year, bucket);
  return acc;
}, new Map<number, typeof poetry>());
const years = [...poemsByYear.keys()].sort((a, b) => b - a);
const illustratedCount = poetry.filter((entry) => entry.headerImage).length;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="Poetry — Chips’nCode"
      description="Poems of wind, sea, starlight, wild country, grief, climate dread, reverence for life, and the search for peace without looking away."
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />

    <main class="poetry-index">
      <PageHeader
        kicker="Poetry / archive"
        title="Poetry"
        lede="Work written across childhood and youth, kept in sequence so the recurring weather, wilderness, grief, joy and longing remain visible."
        variant="index-rail"
        stats={[
          { label: 'Poems', value: poetry.length },
          { label: 'Span', value: earliest && latest ? `${earliest.pubDateValue.getUTCFullYear()}–${latest.pubDateValue.getUTCFullYear()}` : 'n/a' },
          { label: 'Original art', value: illustratedCount },
          { label: 'Order', value: 'Newest first' },
        ]}
      />

      <section class="poetry-curator" aria-labelledby="collection-note-title">
        <div class="poetry-curator__lead">
          <p class="editorial-kicker">Collection note</p>
          <h2 id="collection-note-title">Twenty years of rambling</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="poetry-curator__copy">
          <p>
            These poems were written across more than twenty years, and reading them back now, I am struck less by how
            much changed than by how often the same concerns kept returning. Weather, stars, wilderness, solitude, joy,
            grief, damage and longing all turn up again and again, sometimes years apart and in completely different forms.
          </p>
          <p>
            The natural world sits through most of it, too. Rain, sea, birds, hills, wind and starlight were never just
            scenery to me, although I probably would not have been able to explain that particularly well when I was
            sixteen. Looking back now, I can see how often I was using them to think about scale, consequence, refuge,
            belonging and the sort of life I wanted to live.
          </p>
          <p>
            That continuity is really what the curator’s note is about: what stayed, what changed, where some of it came
            from, and why I have kept this slightly unruly archive intact.
          </p>
          <a href="/poetry/curators-note">Read the full curator’s note →</a>
        </div>
        <aside class="poetry-curator__rights">
          <PoetryRightsNotice compact={true} />
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="poetry-archive" aria-label="Poetry archive">
        <EditorialHeading kicker="Archive" title="Chronology" id="poetry-chronology" align="split" />

        <div class="poetry-archive__shell">
          <nav
            class="poetry-years"
            aria-label="Jump to year"
            data-scrollspy-nav
            data-scrollspy-container="#poetry-archive-scroll"
          >
            <span>Jump to</span>
            {years.map((year) => <a href={`#poetry-year-${year}`} data-scrollspy-link={`poetry-year-${year}`}>{year}</a>)}
          </nav>

          <div id="poetry-archive-scroll" class="poetry-archive__scroll" tabindex="0" aria-labelledby="poetry-chronology">
            {years.map((year) => (
              <section class="poetry-year" aria-labelledby={`poetry-year-${year}`}>
                <div class="poetry-year__head">
                  <h3 id={`poetry-year-${year}`}>{year}</h3>
                  <p>{poemsByYear.get(year)?.length ?? 0} poem{(poemsByYear.get(year)?.length ?? 0) === 1 ? '' : 's'}</p>
                </div>

                <div class="poetry-list">
                  {poemsByYear.get(year)?.map((entry) => (
                    <article class="poetry-row">
                      <div class="poetry-row__meta">
                        <span class="poetry-row__date"><FormattedDate date={entry.pubDateValue} /></span>
                        <span class="poetry-row__artifact">{entry.headerImage ? 'Original art' : 'Text only'}</span>
                      </div>

                      <div class="poetry-row__body">
                        <h4 class="poetry-row__title"><a href={`/poetry/${entry.slug}`}>{entry.title}</a></h4>
                        <p class="poetry-row__excerpt">{entry.excerpt}</p>
                      </div>

                      {entry.headerImage ? (
                        <a class="poetry-row__graphic" href={`/poetry/${entry.slug}`} aria-label={`Open poem: ${entry.title}`}>
                          <img src={entry.headerImage} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                        </a>
                      ) : <span class="poetry-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>}
                    </article>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </section>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .poetry-index {
    max-width: min(1320px, calc(100% - 2 * var(--space-5)));
  }

  .poetry-hero {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }

  .poetry-hero__eyebrow,
  .poetry-hero__title {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .poetry-hero__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .poetry-hero__title {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .poetry-curator {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(280px, 360px);
    column-gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    row-gap: 1.4rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding-top: 1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--border) 78%, transparent);
  }

  .poetry-curator__intro {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    max-width: 70ch;
  }

  .poetry-curator__lede,
  .poetry-curator__paragraph {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .poetry-curator__lede {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.18rem, 1.55vw, 1.42rem);
    line-height: 1.72;
    color: var(--text);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .poetry-ledger {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    border-left: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--border) 84%, transparent);
  }

  .poetry-ledger__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .poetry-ledger__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .poetry-ledger__row {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.7rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--border) 82%, transparent);
  }

  .poetry-ledger__row:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .poetry-ledger__row dt,
  .poetry-ledger__row dd,
  .poetry-ledger__note {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .poetry-ledger__row dt {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .poetry-ledger__row dd {
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .poetry-ledger__note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.68;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
  }

  .poetry-curator__paragraph {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.02vw, 1.06rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .poetry-curator__paragraph--continue {
    width: fit-content;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .poetry-curator__paragraph--continue a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .poetry-curator__paragraph--continue a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.16em;
  }

  .poetry-curator__rights {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    max-width: none;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--border) 78%, transparent);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .poetry-archive {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .poetry-archive__head {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .poetry-archive__eyebrow,
  .poetry-archive__title {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .poetry-archive__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .poetry-year {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .poetry-year__head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding-bottom: 0.55rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .poetry-year__head h3,
  .poetry-year__head p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .poetry-year__head p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .poetry-list {
    display: grid;
  }

  .poetry-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(100px, 124px) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(88px, 132px);
    gap: 1.2rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 0.95rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--border) 74%, transparent);
  }

  .poetry-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .poetry-row__meta {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .poetry-row__date {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .poetry-row__artifact {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .poetry-row__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.32rem;
  }

  .poetry-row__title,
  .poetry-row__excerpt {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .poetry-row__title a {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .poetry-row__title a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .poetry-row__excerpt {
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.62;
    max-width: 64ch;
  }

  .poetry-row__graphic {
    align-self: center;
    justify-self: end;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .poetry-row__graphic img {
    max-width: min(132px, 100%);
    max-height: 48px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    opacity: 0.92;
  }

  .poetry-row__graphicNote {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .poetry-curator {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      column-gap: 0;
      row-gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .poetry-ledger {
      padding-left: 0;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--border) 84%, transparent);
    }

    .poetry-curator__intro,
    .poetry-ledger__note,
    .poetry-row__excerpt {
      max-width: none;
    }

    .poetry-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.7rem;
    }

    .poetry-row__graphic,
    .poetry-row__graphicNote {
      justify-self: start;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
  }

  /* Poetry index: shared editorial language with an archive-specific rhythm. */
  .poetry-index {
    width: min(100% - 48px, 1500px);
    max-width: none;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .poetry-curator {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 0.65fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(220px, 0.6fr);
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .poetry-curator__lead h2 {
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.8vw, 2.7rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .poetry-curator__copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    max-width: 70ch;
  }

  .poetry-curator__copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  .poetry-curator__copy a {
    width: fit-content;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .poetry-curator__rights {
    grid-column: auto;
    padding: 0 0 0 clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    border-top: 0;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .poetry-archive {
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .poetry-archive__shell {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 110px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .poetry-years {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-height, 4.5rem) + 1rem);
    display: grid;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--text);
  }

  .poetry-years span,
  .poetry-years a {
    padding: 0.48rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .poetry-years span {
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .poetry-years a {
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .poetry-years a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    padding-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  .poetry-years a.is-active {
    padding-left: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--text);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tag-ink) 6%, transparent 94%);
    box-shadow: inset 2px 0 0 var(--tag-ink);
  }

  .poetry-archive__scroll {
    max-height: min(72vh, 850px);
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: auto;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--text);
    scrollbar-color: var(--border-2) transparent;
  }

  .poetry-archive__scroll:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .poetry-year {
    gap: 0;
  }

  .poetry-year__head {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 0.38rem 0.65rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--text);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 94%, transparent 6%);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .poetry-year__head h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .poetry-year__head p {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .poetry-list {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .poetry-row {
    grid-template-columns: 84px minmax(0, 1fr) clamp(130px, 10vw, 180px);
    gap: 0.7rem;
    min-height: 108px;
    padding: 0.58rem 0.65rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .poetry-row__date {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
  }

  .poetry-row__artifact {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
  }

  .poetry-row__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.15vw, 1.24rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
  }

  .poetry-row__excerpt {
    display: -webkit-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: clamp(0.86rem, 0.9vw, 0.98rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
  }

  .poetry-row__graphic {
    align-self: start;
  }

  .poetry-row__graphic img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 180px;
    max-height: 82px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: right top;
  }

  .poetry-row__arrow {
    justify-self: end;
    align-self: center;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .poetry-curator {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(200px, 0.65fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr);
    }

    .poetry-curator__rights {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      padding: 0.75rem 0 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .poetry-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .poetry-index {
      width: min(100% - 28px, 1500px);
    }

    .poetry-curator {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .poetry-curator__lead h2 {
      max-width: none;
    }

    .poetry-archive__shell {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .poetry-years {
      position: static;
      display: flex;
      overflow-x: auto;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .poetry-years span,
    .poetry-years a {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.65rem;
      border-bottom: 0;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .poetry-years a.is-active {
      padding-left: 0.65rem;
      box-shadow: inset 0 -2px 0 var(--tag-ink);
    }

    .poetry-row {
      grid-template-columns: 74px minmax(0, 1fr) 112px;
    }

    .poetry-row__graphic img {
      width: 112px;
      max-width: 112px;
      max-height: 68px;
    }
  }
 </style>
